WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.021 --> 00:00:05.820
[Narrator] Today in the biomedical field…&nbsp;
information is everything. Be it genomic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:10.620
research or precision medicine. You need all&nbsp;
the latest updates on your variants of interest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:16.620
and you need them now. The problem is traditional&nbsp;
keyword-based search systems don’t always work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:27.420
An additional challenge is that variants are&nbsp;
mentioned in all parts of an article. This is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:34.560
why we created LitVar, a database built from over&nbsp;
35 million biomedical publications. Including full&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.420
texts and supplementary materials. with&nbsp;
smart AI, we map different variant names&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:46.020
into single concepts. Narrow down your search&nbsp;
results with keywords, or by Article Section,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:58.740
Journal and Year filters. LitVar helps you stay&nbsp;
at the top of your research. Try LitVar Now.

